\f1\fs22 Like the second pentad, it flew many false routes. Unlike the second, it detected human activity\'97shots fired, the almost undetectable footsteps of professional assassins, the more easily followed footsteps of entertainment and hospitality units, and the messy fight between two men who could not fight their way out of a calf-deep pond of orange fish.\
It flew into the courtyard over Alexander and Chanta. Its individual drones were shot at by the assassins and gawked at by the entertainers. They flew elliptically to their target, and then orbited ever faster overhead to generate the closed harmonic resonance fields they needed to disrupt localised three-dimensional space. The target and her companion\'97an inconsequential woman labouring with advanced pregnancy\'97looked up.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl220\sb220\qj\partightenfactor0

